        "title": "Some people say that the only reason for learning a foreign language is in order to travel to or to work in a foreign country. Others say that these are not the only reasons why someone should learn a foreign language. Discuss both views and give your...",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QLTzdupRfoHJSVxdd69lez8jgVf\"><em><strong>Some people say that the only reason for learning a foreign language is in order to travel to or to work in a foreign country. Others say that these are not the only reasons why someone should learn a foreign language. Discuss both views and give your own opinion. </strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Foreign Language Learning Reasons&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PPKpdl288oAcXgxZoGBlCpU0gxg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Foreign Language Learning Reasons&nbsp;cho 2 quan điểm:</strong> Một số người n&oacute;i rằng l&yacute; do duy nhất để học ngoại ngữ l&agrave; để đi du lịch hoặc l&agrave;m việc ở nước ngo&agrave;i.<em> (Quan điểm 1)</em>, trong khi những người kh&aacute;c cho rằng đ&acirc;y kh&ocirc;ng phải l&agrave; những l&yacute; do duy nhất tại sao một người n&ecirc;n học ngoại ngữ.<em> (Quan điểm 2)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KLzWdE6t1ooxbFxJafnlssZ6glg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Thảo luận cả hai quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến của bạn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BzkGdrKUDo3Jd0x91Mcl8nWig4d\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Foreign Language Learning Reasons&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CnkZdbt5no7ZYJx9Odql6VPjgyb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CofldRPnZojqBOx6Ggflg8VggEd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UlZjdNVANo5khdx965TlHLxngW6\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>travel and work purposes <em>(mục đ&iacute;ch du lịch v&agrave; c&ocirc;ng việc)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YdQAd7rgAopxL5xXrUFlWSCggyf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>practical applications <em>(ứng dụng thực tế)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Awc2dODEAoo1JIx5ksylbb6vgOc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>career advancement <em>(thăng tiến nghề nghiệp)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2IadOJlpovHy5x2bSMlZNHjgCh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>tourism <em>(du lịch)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoHodFLzgoIfzyxCaZAlShJjgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoHodFLzgoIfzyxCaZAlShJjgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuMjdHNO7o6RDZxhCF7lLQ1wg0d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NzXOdXc1go9lLpxgoEil3rBRgZe\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong> với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm thứ 2, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>mọi người n&ecirc;n học ngoại ngữ kh&ocirc;ng chỉ v&igrave; c&aacute;c l&yacute; do duy nhất l&agrave; để du lịch hay l&agrave;m việc ở nước ngo&agrave;i.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X0l8dWWyAo8rkexWE8PlG1VogMg\">&rarr; Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 body như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA7fd0XgPoP5MQxgWUel82ZbgKf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ đ&oacute;ng vai ng&ocirc;i thứ 3: B&agrave;n về l&yacute; do tại sao một số người lại cho rằng thăng tiến nghề nghiệp v&agrave; du lịch l&agrave; những yếu tố th&uacute;c đẩy quan trọng để nhiều người học ngoại ngữ.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoXLdUfDOoUnQWxYK13lpFfbgAd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm của ri&ecirc;ng c&aacute; nh&acirc;n m&igrave;nh: Nhiều người n&ecirc;n học ngoại ngữ do c&oacute; nhiều lợi &iacute;ch mang lại gi&aacute; trị l&acirc;u d&agrave;i đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JBMLdacl4oR5bNx3ifSlXXB9gxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EDXcdVEq3oLG9nxeC8iloJr8gse\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UM6ZdZqdoovj0AxD6j8lsktlg4b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GirmdW8Dnoj2h8xZr6JlE8Tbgld\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VeN8deE2eohFuUxItlrlFbo5gkm\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết Body 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về l&yacute; do tại sao một số người lại cho rằng thăng tiến nghề nghiệp v&agrave; du lịch l&agrave; những yếu tố th&uacute;c đẩy quan trọng để nhiều người học ngoại ngữ.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WFlOdn0L6o9tGSxuugml62PSg9d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A6ABdum2roKdXNxQrTWlclq5gKd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLtCd8WGXo2M6TxHo1Ll9lFBgbg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GZ3sdRBwzodba4xod8rlGKQWgVe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:</strong> </span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, <em>lợi &iacute;ch nghề nghiệp v&agrave; du lịch (professional and travel-related benefits) </em>tạo ra động lực mạnh mẽ cho <em>việc tiếp thu ng&ocirc;n ngữ (language acquisition)</em>.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LwLIdS7IroaFq6xhsnNltnEEgRc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P2pGdrdWVoaWvlxEKJpl5WnfgRc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Về <em>triển vọng nghề nghiệp (career prospects)</em>, <em>c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty đa quốc gia (multinational companies) </em>ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng ưu ti&ecirc;n <em>nh&acirc;n vi&ecirc;n song ngữ (bilingual employees)</em>, dẫn đến mức lương cao hơn v&agrave; <em>cơ hội thăng tiến (promotion opportunities)</em> tốt hơn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B1epdPGVfo3NsexZXDoldk2agMg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> V&iacute; dụ, những người n&oacute;i tiếng Anh trong <em>ng&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng nghệ (tech industry)</em> Việt Nam thường c&oacute; <strong>lợi thế đ&aacute;ng kể</strong> so với c&aacute;c ứng vi&ecirc;n đơn ngữ khi cạnh tranh cho <em>c&aacute;c vị tr&iacute; cao cấp (senior positions)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkNedflHyoFHoSxUPO7lSqiWgAE\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2: </strong>Ngo&agrave;i ra, <em>giao tiếp hiệu quả (effective communication)</em> khi đi du lịch nước ngo&agrave;i gi&uacute;p kh&aacute;ch du lịch tr&aacute;nh <em>r&agrave;o cản ng&ocirc;n ngữ (language barriers)</em> khi di chuyển trong nh&agrave; h&agrave;ng, kh&aacute;ch sạn v&agrave; hệ thống giao th&ocirc;ng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XUWadVuPwoPsE0xGBGAliSC7gtg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Kết quả l&agrave;, khả năng n&agrave;y mang lại <em>những trải nghiệm du lịch (travel experiences)</em> th&uacute; vị v&agrave; <em>kh&ocirc;ng căng thẳng (stress-free)</em> hơn cho du kh&aacute;ch ở c&aacute;c nước ngo&agrave;i.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết Body 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm của ri&ecirc;ng c&aacute; nh&acirc;n m&igrave;nh: Nhiều người n&ecirc;n học ngoại ngữ do c&oacute; nhiều lợi &iacute;ch mang lại gi&aacute; trị l&acirc;u d&agrave;i đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MTcmdZobEoTmv6x3FLVlPSQfgzd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IQk7dtFfcodO74x8BqAlUFO8gug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pz3Xdb2aLo9ZTbxB301lvayRgjh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RFlPdKKqborJ8GxKRhflPz3ugTh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, <em>ph&aacute;t triển c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (personal development)</em> v&agrave; <em>l&agrave;m gi&agrave;u văn h&oacute;a (cultural enrichment)</em> mang lại <em>gi&aacute; trị d&agrave;i hạn (long-term value) </em>đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YOSUdxPaIoz8Xpxm0jOldqZ6gXd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UM3rdEmuBo4JK5x93wqljw2lgic\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Lợi &iacute;ch ch&iacute;nh l&agrave; việc học ng&ocirc;n ngữ n&acirc;ng cao <em>khả năng nhận thức (cognitive abilities)</em> bằng c&aacute;ch cải thiện tr&iacute; nhớ v&agrave; <em>kỹ năng giải quyết vấn đề (problem-solving skills)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SZTCdDLnXoOSukx9OhalIehkgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Do đ&oacute;, <em>sự k&iacute;ch th&iacute;ch tinh thần (mental stimulation)</em> n&agrave;y dẫn đến <em>t&iacute;nh linh hoạt tr&iacute; tuệ (mental flexibility)</em> tốt hơn v&agrave; <em>th&agrave;nh t&iacute;ch học tập (academic performance)</em> trong c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n học kh&aacute;c như to&aacute;n học v&agrave; khoa học.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TMUId3RhGoWfXbxaI3OlaitZgid\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WlwxdfFu8odWVfx6bbKlKxIlgog\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong><em> </em>Hơn nữa, việc học ng&ocirc;n ngữ nu&ocirc;i dưỡng <em>sự hiểu biết văn h&oacute;a (cultural understanding)</em> bằng c&aacute;ch kết nối người học với c&aacute;c truyền thống v&agrave; quan điểm kh&aacute;c nhau từ khắp nơi tr&ecirc;n thế giới.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QwXLd2DeyoVah5xCsBLlphLagdd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh n&agrave;y ph&aacute;t triển <em>sự đồng cảm (empathy)</em> v&agrave; <em>tư duy to&agrave;n cầu (global mindset)</em>, gi&uacute;p <em>ph&aacute; bỏ những định kiến v&agrave; th&agrave;nh kiến (break down stereotypes and prejudices)</em> thường chia rẽ cộng đồng v&agrave; tạo ra <em>r&agrave;o cản x&atilde; hội (social barriers)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HhjYd198Qo0hYvxQQmNlpg7jg9b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HOWkdIOeZo0JGixz9LXllvnxgdb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E0VOdfBTuoctEdx0hYjlN3ifgtc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QliLdzMWVoom9gxNUDNlgvirg3c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>practical motivations <em>(động lực thực tế)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KquNd4ovyohyEox9d0tldKR9gND\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>travel convenience <em>(tiện lợi du lịch)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JeemdTKfQoNNiNxb8vilfkmAglc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>personal growth <em>(sự ph&aacute;t triển c&aacute; nh&acirc;n)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FJljdWKVko87i5xgU9AlVtg7gtg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>cultural awareness <em>(nhận thức văn h&oacute;a)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0uOdzRDUo0NpGxm5YblDUJvgsc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>foreign language study <em>(việc học ngoại ngữ)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SWj1dGGDuolBtIxPM3flS45xgDb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>lasting benefits <em>(lợi &iacute;ch l&acirc;u d&agrave;i)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GiUuddF5GoniekxzlxSlMuwjg2b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">immediate needs <em>(nhu cầu trước mắt)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1508,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XfgmdXqL2o9ODAxxgDVlzfdkg4e\">Opinions are divided on whether learning a foreign language is solely for travel and work purposes or if there are additional motivations. Although practical applications such as career advancement and tourism are important drivers, I believe there are more compelling reasons beyond these utilitarian goals.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17943,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1509,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F97KdJVhPoOxMUx0jaolQSq2gEc\"><strong>Admittedly, professional and travel-related benefits provide strong incentives for language acquisition.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Regarding career prospects, multinational companies increasingly prefer bilingual employees, leading to higher salaries and better promotion opportunities. For example, English speakers in Vietnam's tech industry often enjoy significant advantages over monolingual candidates when competing for senior positions.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, effective communication while traveling abroad helps tourists avoid language barriers when navigating restaurants, hotels, and transportation systems. As a result, this ability leads to more enjoyable and stress-free travel experiences for visitors in foreign countries.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17943,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1510,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IXAvdr7C4oGk7gxb3zulgJuJguh\"><strong>However, personal development and cultural enrichment offer more significant long-term value. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">The primary advantage is that learning languages enhances cognitive abilities by improving memory and problem-solving skills. Consequently, this mental stimulation leads to better mental flexibility and academic performance in other subjects such as mathematics and science. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, language learning fosters cultural understanding by connecting learners to different traditions and perspectives from around the world. This process develops empathy and a global mindset, helping to break down stereotypes and prejudices that often divide communities and create social barriers.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17943,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1511,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KzhGdf9WOoMHp1xcYR7laxyBgEd\">In conclusion, while practical motivations like career advancement and travel convenience are certainly valid reasons, the personal growth and cultural awareness gained through foreign language study provide more meaningful and lasting benefits that extend far beyond immediate needs.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17943,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
        "time_limit": 30
      }
